+# Engine Patches for Visualization Event Log (`--events-output`)
+
+This document records all modifications and additions inside `engine/` to emit a structured v1 NDJSON simulation event stream conforming to `../schema/events.schema.json` when `--events-output <path>` is enabled, while preserving BLIS invariants when `--events-output` is omitted or enabled.
+
+## Invariants Preserved
+
+1. **INV-6 Determinism & Zero Behavioral Perturbation**: Attaching a `sim.EventSink` (`--events-output`) is purely observational. It never mutates RNG streams, scheduling order, gateway admission/routing decisions, or instance state transitions. Smoke testing `blis run` with and without `--events-output` produces byte-identical stdout `Result` JSON (outside `runtime`).
+2. **Stdout Purity**: `blis run` and `blis replay` continue writing the `Result` document exclusively to stdout (or `--output`); all NDJSON records go exclusively to the `--events-output` file. `--events-output` is exempted in `cmd/result_flags.go` alongside report-only output flags.
+3. **DEV-13 Output Length Isolation**: Arrival/routing event emission reads only `req.MaxOutputLen`, never `req.OutputTokens` (enforced by `TestDEV13_SampledOutputLengthIsReadOnlyAtDeclaredSites`).
+4. **Package Import Boundaries**: All `blis-vllm` / kernel inspection for `HeaderRecord.Topology` (`Pools`, `GPUSpecs`, `MemoryBreakdownBytes`) and `sim.ModelRooflineSpec` lives strictly inside `cmd/engine_build.go`. No `cmd/` copy of engine setting validation checks is introduced (enforced by `TestCmdChecksNoEngineSettingTheBuildSiteAdopts`).
+
+---
+
+## Added Files
+
+### Core Engine & Schema (`sim/`)
+- `sim/events_schema.go`: Go structs and JSON tags for `HeaderRecord` (`schema_version: "1.0"`, BLIS provenance, scenario, topology) and all v1 `EventRecord` types matching `../schema/events.schema.json`.
+- `sim/events_sink.go`: `EventSink` interface, buffered thread-safe `JSONLEventSink` (writing monotonic `seq` and compact NDJSON lines via `bufio.Writer`), and `NopEventSink`.
+- `sim/kv_block_tracker.go`: Pure observational shadow tracker mapping engine logical KV block keys to physical block IDs and tracking GPU/CPU tier residency and prefix cache hits for `kv.block.*` events without altering engine simulation.
+- `sim/roofline.go`: Analytical `ModelRooflineSpec` computation (`ComputeBatchRoofline`) producing `flops`, `bytes_moved`, `arithmetic_intensity`, `achieved_tflops`, `achieved_bw_tbs`, `bottleneck`, `compute_util`, `bw_util`, and `bound_by` from batch composition and model/GPU parameters.
+- `sim/engine_driver_events.go`: Observational driver helpers (`FlushSinkEvents`, `CachedKVBlocksCount`, `recordStepEvents`, buffered `pendingSinkEvent` queue for `kickGroup` steps) emitting `request.queued`, `request.scheduled`, `batch.step`, `request.prefill`, `request.decode_step`, `request.preempted`, `request.finished`, `request.timed_out`, and `kv.block.*` events.
+- `sim/events_test.go`: Unit tests covering NDJSON serialization, KV shadow tracker allocation/caching/eviction/tier movement, roofline calculations, `EngineDriver` event emission, and INV-6 parity.
+
+### Cluster & Gateway Wiring (`sim/cluster/`)
+- `sim/cluster/events_emit.go`: `ClusterSimulator` event emission helpers (`SetEventSink`, `SetEventSnapshotInterval`, `InitialPodsInfo`, `emitInitialPodEvents`, `emitPodCreatedAndLoading`, `emitPodTransitionEvent`, `emitRequestArrived` with deterministic chained SHA-256 `block_hashes`, `emitRequestRouted` with `request.admitted` + read-only `counterfactual` candidates/regret, `emitGatewayRejection` mapping `RejectedClientTimeout` to `request.timed_out` and rejections to mapped stages, `emitDecodeKVRejection` for `decode_kv`, `emitKVTransferStarted`/`emitKVTransferCompleted`, and periodic/final `maybeEmitMetricsSnapshot` with `[0, 1]`-clamped `prefix_cache_hit_rate`).
+- `sim/cluster/events_emit_test.go`: Unit tests covering cluster event emission, candidate scoring with `TraceLevel="none"`, pod transition deduplication (no duplicate `pod.ready` across `WarmingUp -> Active`), gateway rejection/timeout stage mapping, periodic/final `metrics.snapshot`, and INV-6 parity.
+
+### CLI (`cmd/`)
+- `cmd/events_output.go`: `--events-output` flag registration and `eventsOutput` lifecycle manager opening the NDJSON sink, building `HeaderRecord` (BLIS commit/versions from `EngineReleases()`, `debug.ReadBuildInfo()`, and embedded `stack.json`, plus scenario/router/topology metadata), attaching the sink to `DeploymentConfig`, flushing/closing after simulation, and failing cleanly on I/O errors without touching stdout.
+
+---
+
+## Modified Files
+
+### Engine Driver (`sim/`)
+- `sim/engine_driver.go`: Extended `EngineDriverConfig` (`EventSink`, `PodID`, `GPUsPerPod`, `TPDegree`, `KVBlockSize`, `KVBlocksTotal`, `CPUBlocksTotal`, `HasCPUOffload`, `RooflineSpec`) and `EngineDriver` (`SetEventSink`, `SetPodEventMeta`, `HasCPUOffload`, `CPUBlocksTotal`, enqueue/preempt/timeout/kv/step event hooks).
+- `sim/engine_driver_group.go`: Flushes/records `kickGroup` step events in lockstep timestamp order when `EventSink` is active.
+- `sim/engine_driver_handoff.go`: Records P/D / tier KV handoff observation metadata in the driver's event state.
+
+### Cluster Simulator (`sim/cluster/`)
+- `sim/cluster/deployment.go`: Added `EventSink`, `EventSnapshotIntervalUs`, `RooflineSpec`, `RooflineSpecsByRole`, `HasCPUOffload`, and `CPUBlocksTotal` to `DeploymentConfig`.
+- `sim/cluster/cluster.go`: Added `ClusterSimulator` event fields (`eventSink`, `eventSnapshotIntervalUs`, `nextEventSnapshotClockUs`, `initialPodsEmitted`, `nextTransferSeq`, `transferIDs`), synced event sink + pool-role roofline/offload metadata to startup and `addLiveInstance` pods, wired `emitPodTransitionEvent` in `wireInstance`, emitted initial pod events at `Run()` start, flushed periodic snapshots during the event loop, and emitted final `metrics.snapshot` (`is_final: true`) after `checkFates()`.
+- `sim/cluster/instance.go`: Added `readyEmitted` and `drainReason` tracking on `InstanceSimulator`, plus pass-through accessors (`CachedKVBlocksCount`, `FlushSinkEvents`, `HasCPUOffload`, `CPUBlocksTotal`, `SetEventSink`, `SetPodEventMeta`).
+- `sim/cluster/direct_actuator.go`: Tagged `inst.drainReason = "autoscaler_scale_down"` prior to draining transitions in `scaleDown`.
+- `sim/cluster/infra_lifecycle_event.go`: Tagged `inst.drainReason = "node_drain"` prior to immediate/wait/redirect node drain transitions.
+- `sim/cluster/cluster_event.go`: Emitted `request.arrived` in `ClusterArrivalEvent.Execute` for initial (non-redirected) cluster arrivals.
+- `sim/cluster/gateway.go`: Emitted `request.rejected` / `request.timed_out` in `GatewayHost.Reject` and `request.admitted` + `request.routed` (with candidate scores even when `cs.trace == nil`) in `recordRouting`.
+- `sim/cluster/pd_events.go`: Emitted `request.rejected` (`stage: "decode_kv"`) in `dropAtStart` and nil/non-routable decode completion branches, and `kv.transfer` (`started` in `scheduleTransferCompletion`, `completed` in `KVTransferCompletedEvent.Execute` with `nixlOutcomeReason`).
+
+### CLI (`cmd/`)
+- `cmd/engine_build.go`: Added `buildEventTopologySpecs` (`poolSpecFromModel`, `rooflineSpecFromKernel`, `resolveEventCPUTier`) inside `cmd/engine_build.go` to extract `PoolConfig` (`gpu_specs` from `hardware.Chip`, `memory_breakdown_bytes` from `k.FixedBytes()`), `ModelRooflineSpec` from `model.Graph` + `kernelmodel.Model`, and `HeaderTiers` for `HeaderRecord` and driver roofline specs.
+- `cmd/root.go`: Registered `--events-output` on `runCmd` and wired `setupEventStream`, `attachAndWriteHeader`, and `finish`.
+- `cmd/replay.go`: Registered `--events-output` on `replayCmd` and wired `setupEventStream`, `attachAndWriteHeader`, and `finish`.
+- `cmd/result_flags.go`: Exempted `events-output` in `resultFlagsExempt` (`"run"`, `"replay"`) and `optionsExcluded`.
